    {
      "id": "higher_math_1st-ch10-mcq-003",
      "text": "\\(f(x) = \\sin 2x\\) হলে—",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "statements": [
        {
          "label": "i",
          "text": "\\(\\displaystyle\\int f(x)\\,dx = -\\dfrac{\\cos 2x}{2} + c\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "ii",
          "text": "\\(\\displaystyle\\int \\sqrt{1 + f(x)}\\,dx = \\sin x - \\cos x + c\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "iii",
          "text": "\\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi/2} \\sqrt{1 - f(x)}\\,dx = 0\\)"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "i ও ii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "i ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "i, ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "answer_source": "printed",
      "explanation": "(i) \\(\\int\\sin2x\\,dx = -\\dfrac{\\cos2x}{2}+c\\) — সত্য।\n(ii) \\(1+\\sin2x = (\\sin x+\\cos x)^2\\), তাই \\(\\int(\\sin x+\\cos x)dx = \\sin x-\\cos x+c\\) — সত্য।\n(iii) \\(\\sqrt{1-\\sin2x}=|\\sin x-\\cos x|\\); \\(0\\) থেকে \\(\\pi/2\\) পর্যন্ত এটি সর্বত্র অঋণাত্মক ও অশূন্য অংশ আছে, মান \\(2(\\sqrt2-1)\\ne0\\) — মিথ্যা।",
      "source": {
        "board": "BB",
        "year": "2023",
        "qno": 19,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
